# Belt-and-braces: files from the parent working folder that must never be
# published. Copying one in by mistake is the realistic failure — the parent's
# README.md and this repo's README.md are different documents with the same
# name, and the parent's carries a DID, local paths and machine details.
# Listing them here means git will not stage them even if they land in this
# directory. (This repo's own README.md is tracked and unaffected.)
CLAUDE.md
CODEX-検査要件.md
check-publish.mjs
codex-review*.md
data.js
data2.js
*_判定ページ.html
*.xml
agent.json
llms.txt
patterns.md
skill.md
